			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 400701601,
					"content": "奇怪，一路過來只有島上的本土怪物，沒有愚人眾了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400701602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400701602,
					"content": "駐紮的痕跡和裝置都還在，但人都不見了，好奇怪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400701603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400701603,
					"content": "（我一直認為，這些幻境的誕生與這台愚人眾裝置關係很大。它看起來已經壞了，也許這就是問題的根源。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400701604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400701604,
					"content": "（…假如裝置能讓人產生幻覺，那他們自己為什麼消失了？還是說，另有隱情？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400701605
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400701605,
					"content": "（找不到人，是因為他們消失了，還是他們在躲避我們？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400701606
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400701606,
					"content": "算了，占卜一下看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400701607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400701607,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400701608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400701608,
					"content": "嗯？這是…力量在流動？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400701609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400701609,
					"content": "各位，似乎沒能占出愚人眾的蹤跡，水占盤又變得渾濁了，但這次我能感知到某種力量正在匯聚成型。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400701610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400701610,
					"content": "目的地是…那邊的小島。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400701611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400701611,
					"content": "這次會是跟誰有關的幻境呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400701612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "辛焱"
				},
				{
					"id": 400701612,
					"content": "唔…過去看看吧，說不定會有線索。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				}
			]
		},
